// A grade says where a machine sits in its upgrade chain and what upgrading it costs:
//   tier : position in the chain, higher = better (the infinity upgrade moves a machine to the
//          registered machine of the SAME kind with the next-higher tier)
//   cost : durability the infinity upgrade loses when upgrading INTO this machine, i.e. when the
